t the normal vector $n=⟨-3,6,2⟩.$ \n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|1\\cdot (-3)+2\\cdot 6+6\\cdot 2|}{\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+{6}^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-3+12+12|}{\\sqrt{9+36+4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|21|}{\\sqrt{49}} \\\\  & =\\frac{21}{7} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339551 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339552 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339553 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339554 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1000 #edb/ref 17592186339555 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1041 "selection" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1104 #edb/ref 17592186339551 13194139535243 true] [17592186339550 1110 #uuid "bf17f808-2d80-5762-96cb-c48a69767c4e" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339551 1034 "3" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339551 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535243 true] [17592186339551 1111 #uuid "efa9c94b-076e-5b1e-867a-0dd554335634" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339552 1034 "2" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339552 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535243 true] [17592186339552 1111 #uuid "c0ba8bcc-dd78-543e-905f-28c62d67ea3c" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339553 1034 "1" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339553 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535243 true] [17592186339553 1111 #uuid "6a021570-d057-5990-90d1-4b089d124d7a" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339554 1034 "4" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339554 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535243 true] [17592186339554 1111 #uuid "4121a510-a275-5426-b359-62b90f0b4d8f" 13194139535243 true] [17592186339555 1034 "